I tag this with an [s] tag because Slash'EM not only is Nethack's
laboratory for experiments, but because Slash'EM already houses the
lycanthrope and vampire - two races that make for very different games
than the Nethack norm.

Goblins - Low strength, constitution and charisma; good dexterity. The
in-game description mentions ingenious devices and mining ability, so
maybe they should get the gnome's tinker ability. Otherwise, should
get the orc's abilities - infravision, poison resistance and the like.

Kobolds - Low strength, constitution, and wisdom; good dexterity and
intelligence. Should probably have some "escape" type ability, like
the vanish or blink technique. Should also have the ability to create
traps; probably (yet another) technique, requires some of the relevant
item. Dart traps require traps, falling rock traps some stones, et
cetera.

Feel free to come forth with your own ideas - this is Slash'EM, the
impossible is possible and the weird is commonplace.



